        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "Integrated Postsecondary Education Data System (IPEDS)",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "9b1f76ff9711404c861e59dc3fa7d037"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "IPEDS provides annual institution- and cohort-level postsecondary education data. It supplies pathway and completion context; it does not establish that an initiative caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "412ff593e9154012a43d4c27ec5c68b6"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "https://nces.ed.gov/ipeds/",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
  {
    "type": "updateEntity",
    "id": {
      "$bytes": "c543c2a58e934589ae804e844ae87760"
    },
    "set": [
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "a126ca530c8e48d5b88882c734c38935"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "IPEDS catalog metadata",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "property": {
          "$bytes": "e3e363d1dd294ccb8e6ff3b76d99bc33"
        },
        "value": {
          "type": "text",
          "value": "## Catalog metadata\n\n- **Steward:** National Center for Education Statistics.\n- **Access:** Downloadable complete data files and custom data tools.\n- **Unit:** Postsecondary institution and cohort.\n- **Coverage:** Annual releases with component-specific history.\n- **Geography:** Institution, state, and nation.\n- **Join keys:** UNITID, state, and reporting year.\n- **Measures:** Enrollment, awards, graduation, finance, and staffing.\n- **Use boundary:** Institutional outcomes are not direct student-level follow-up for a K–12 initiative.\n\nIPEDS provides postsecondary pathway supply and completion context. Its released values do not alone establish that a program caused an outcome.",
          "language": {
            "$bytes": "090adac0fca4822e8e719263e67620ec"
          }
        }
      }
    ],
    "unset": []
  },
